#: core/dplugins/generic/metadata/metadataedit/xmp/xmpsubjects.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the Informative Provider Reference. I.P.R is a name registered "
"with the XMP/NAA, identifying the provider that provides an indicator of the "
"content. The default value for the I.P.R is \"XMP\" if a standard Reference "
"Code is used."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ovdje Informative Provider Reference. I.P.R je ime registrovano sa "
"XMP/NAA, identificirajući provajder koji osigurava indikator sadržaja. "
"Početna vrijednost za I.P.R je \"XMP\" ako je standarni Referentni Broj "
"korišten."

#: core/dplugins/generic/metadata/metadataedit/xmp/xmpsubjects.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the Subject Reference Number. Provides a numeric code to indicate "
"the Subject Name plus optional Subject Matter and Subject Detail Names in "
"the language of the service. Subject Reference is a number from the range "
"01000000 to 17999999 and represent a language independent international "
"reference to a Subject. A Subject is identified by its Reference Number and "
"corresponding Names taken from a standard lists given by XMP/NAA. If a "
"standard reference code is used, these lists are the English language "
"reference versions. This field is limited to 8 digit code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ovdje Referentni Broj Teme. Obezbjeđuje numerisani kod koji indicira "
"Ime Teme plus opcionalno Materiju Teme i Detaljno Ime Teme u jeziku servisa. "
"Referenca Teme je broj u rasponu od 01000000 do 17999999 i predstavlja "
"neovisni internacionalni jezik referenciran na Temu. Tema je identificirana "
"od svog Referentnog Broja i odgovara Imenima uzetim sa standardne liste date "
"sa XMP/NAA. Ako je standardni referentni kod korišten, ove liste su "
"referencirane verzije Engleskog jezika. Ovo polje je ograničeno sa 8 "
"digitalnih kodova."

#: core/dplugins/generic/metadata/metadataedit/xmp/xmpsubjects.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the Subject Name. English language is used if you selected a "
"standard XMP/NAA reference code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ovdje Ime Teme. Engleski jezik je korišten ako odaberete standardni "
"XMP/NAA referentni broj."

#: core/dplugins/generic/metadata/metadataedit/xmp/xmpsubjects.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the Subject Matter Name. English language is used if you selected "
"a standard XMP/NAA reference code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ovdje Ime Glavne Teme. Engleski jezik je korišten ako odaberete "
"standardni XMP/NAA referentni broj."

#: core/dplugins/generic/metadata/metadataedit/xmp/xmpsubjects.cpp:80
#, kde-format
