#: core/libs/template/subjectedit.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the Informative Provider Reference here. I.P.R is a name registered "
"with the XMP/NAA, identifying the provider that provides an indicator of the "
"content. The default value for the I.P.R is \"XMP\" if a standard Reference "
"Code is used."
msgstr ""
"Unesite informativnu preporuku dobavljača (IPD).  IPD je ime registrirano sa "
"XMP/NAA, koje identificira dobavljača koji obezbjeđuje pokazivanje sadržaja. "
"Podrazumijevana vrijednost za IPD je \"XMP\" ako se koristi standardni kod "
"preporuke."

#: core/libs/template/subjectedit.cpp:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the Subject Reference Number here. Provides a numeric code to indicate "
"the Subject Name plus optional Subject Matter and Subject Detail Names in "
"the language of the service. Subject Reference is a number from the range "
"01000000 to 17999999 and represent a language independent international "
"reference to a Subject. A Subject is identified by its Reference Number and "
"corresponding Names taken from a standard lists given by XMP/NAA. If a "
"standard reference code is used, these lists are the English language "
"reference versions. This field is limited to 8 digit code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broj reference predmeta. Obezbjeđuje numerički kod da naznači naziv "
"predmeta i, opcionalno, temu predmeta i detaljni naziv predmeta na jeziku "
"službe. Referenca predmeta je broj u opsegu od 01000000 do 17999999 i "
"predstavlja jezički nezavisnu internacionalnu referencu na predmet. Predmet "
"je identificiran svojim referentnim brojem i odgovarajućim imenima uzetim sa "
"standardnih listi datih od strane XMP/NAA. Ako se koristi standardni "
"referentni kod, ove liste su na verzije referenci na engleskom jeziku. Ovo "
"polje je ograničeno na 8 cifara koda."

#: core/libs/template/subjectedit.cpp:74
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the Subject Name here. English language is used if you selected a "
"standard XMP/NAA reference code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite naziv predmeta. Ako ste odabrali standardni XMP/NAA referentni kod, "
"koristi se engleski jezik."

#: core/libs/template/subjectedit.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the Subject Matter Name here. English language is used if you selected "
"a standard XMP/NAA reference code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite naziv teme predmeta. Ako ste odabrali standardni XMP/NAA referentni "
"kod, koristi se engleski jezik."

#: core/libs/template/subjectedit.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the Subject Detail Name here. English language is used if you selected "
"a standard XMP/NAA reference code."
msgstr ""
"Unesite detaljni naziv predmeta. Ako ste odabrali standardni XMP/NAA "
"referentni kod, koristi se engleski jezik."

